// A dig aimed past the mole's 4.5 m reach answers at once ("Too far to dig: you reach 4.5 m."), once a press;
// clicking again inside 5 s clinks without repeating the words. In reach, the same rock digs as usual.
map
BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB
B....................................B
B....................................B
B....................................B
B....................................B
B..@...............................rrB
BBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBBB
end
mode survival
nohunger
mine 3-30 32 0
expect 4 log:too_far == 1
expect 31 log:too_far == 1
mine 40-50 32 0
expect 51 log:too_far == 1
mine 400-410 32 0
expect 411 log:too_far == 2
expect 411 is:32,0,Rock == 1
hold 420-560 right
mine 561-700 32 0
expect 701 is:32,0,Rock == 0
expect 701 log:too_far == 2
